<.shell current={:ai_writing}>
  <h1>AI writing</h1>
  <p class="lead">Asks in plain words, and AI's replies, beside what it changes.</p>

  <div class="demo">
    <.ai_editor id="ai-writing-demo" ai?={true} column_id="ai-writing-demo-column">
      <:column>
        <.ai_writing
          id="ai-writing-demo-ai"
          ai={:ok}
          form={Phoenix.Component.to_form(%{"ask" => ""}, as: "ai")}
          asks={SampleData.ai_asks()}
          label="Describe a change"
          button="Change it"
          sees="AI works only with the agency's blank form, the form language, and your team's field names. Agents never see your team's members or records."
        />
      </:column>
      <p class="hint">The page's main part: the report, or the form tried on an activity.</p>
    </.ai_editor>
  </div>

  <h3>An ask running</h3>
  <div class="demo">
    <div class="measure">
      <.ai_writing
        id="ai-writing-demo-running"
        ai={:ok}
        form={Phoenix.Component.to_form(%{"ask" => ""}, as: "ai")}
        asks={[]}
        pending={%{ask: "Write this form."}}
        step={:reading}
        label="Describe a change"
        button="Change it"
        sees="AI works only with the report language and your team's field names. Agents never see your team's members or records."
      />
    </div>
  </div>

  <h3>Closed</h3>
  <div class="demo">
    <div class="measure">
      <.ai_writing
        id="ai-writing-demo-closed"
        ai={{:error, :paused}}
        form={Phoenix.Component.to_form(%{"ask" => ""}, as: "ai")}
        asks={[]}
        label="Describe a change"
        button="Change it"
        closed="AI writing is paused until next month. You can still change the query yourself."
        sees="AI works only with the report language and your team's field names. Agents never see your team's members or records."
      />
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2>When to use</h2>
  <p>
    A page AI writes for a team admin: Change report and Change form. One column, beside
    the page's main part from 1024px and above it under that.
  </p>

  <h2>How it works</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      The asks show as a conversation, oldest first: each ask on the right, AI's reply under it.
    </li>
    <li>A reply that changed the page has Undo, which puts it back to before that ask.</li>
    <li>A form's reply ends with Left blank: each label AI didn't fill, and why.</li>
    <li>
      A running ask shows at once, with its step and Stop. The box clears and its button waits.
    </li>
    <li>AI suggests no next asks. Every ask is one someone typed.</li>
    <li>The hint under the box says what AI sees, and links to How agents work with SAR Duty.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>In the app</h2>
  <p>
    <code>&lt;.ai_editor&gt;</code>
    and <code>&lt;.ai_writing&gt;</code>
    in <code>Web.Components.AIWriting</code>. The page runs each ask with
    <code>App.Operation.AskAI</code>
    and keeps the conversation.
  </p>
</.shell>
